    <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
      <body>
        <div rend="parallel">
            <p xml:id="Aink447-kilavi">vēntaṟku uṟṟuḻip pirinta talaimakaṉ avaṇ viṉaimuṟṟi mīḷum vēṭkaiyāṉāyp paruva varaviṉkaṇ talaimakaḷai niṉaittuc colliyatu.</p>
            <p xml:lang="en">The hero, who had separated for a royal emergency, having become one whose desire was to complete the work there and return, at the arrival of the season [of his intended departure], thought of the heroine and spoke [this].</p>
              </div>
        <div rend="parallel">
          <lg xml:id="Aink447">        
            <l>piṇivīṭu peṟuka maṉṉavaṉ ṟoḻilē</l>
            <l>paṉivaḷar taḷaviṉ ciralvāyc cemmukai</l>
            <l>yāṭu ciṟaivaṇ ṭaviḻppap</l>
            <l>pāṭal cāṉṟa kāṇkamvā ṇutalē.</l>
        </lg>  
 <lg xml:lang="en">                    
<l>May I obtain release from the binds of the king's task!</l>
<l>While the the bee with beating wings opens</l>
<l>the red buds, like a kingfisher's mouth,</l>
<l>of the wild jasmine that grows in the dew,</l>
<l>let us see the bright forehead that is worhy of song.</l>
</lg>                      
        </div>
      </body>
    </text>
